Selection
The function template nth element is used for selection, and as expected has O(N) average-
case running time. The parameters include a pair of iterators, and k:
• void nth element( iterator begin, int k, iterator end )
• void nth element( iterator begin, int k, iterator end, Comparator c)
As a result of calling nth element, the item in the kth position is the kth smallest element,
where counting as usual in C++ begins at 0.
